About the patch:

* Monst.c's colour assignment guidelines indicate that Kings, Queens
and Princes should have magenta as their colour. I think you should
colour Kop Kaptains red (or orange) and put Croesus in magenta.
* Have you tried compiling the patched source without the KOPS option?

About the idea:

I consider each symbol class to indicate monsters with common
biological traits (hence blessed _geno_cide.) I dislike placing
monsters of the same species in different classes, (which is why I want
to move rust monsters to 'a' and disenchanters to 'q', except that I
don't know what to put in the now-vacant 'R' class) but I can see the
practicality for trimming the '@' class. However, I feel that Keystone
Kops are so inherently different to the military/mercenary humans (both
the watch and the guards have M2_MERC flags, after all) that I feel
grouping them together would be erronous.



